WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:44.960
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:45.230 --> 00:47.897
Well, that settles it.

3
00:47.897 --> 00:50.564
That you are not the culprit.

4
00:55.522 --> 00:56.605
Well…

5
00:56.605 --> 00:59.689
Anyway, what should we do? The car is all burned up.

6
00:59.689 --> 01:02.397
Now we have no way of proving the car was hacked.

7
01:02.397 --> 01:04.522
Actually, we can.

8
01:04.522 --> 01:09.023
I regularly upload the vehicle data to a backup cloud server.

9
01:09.023 --> 01:12.731
At first, I only uploaded driving logs and test driving records.

10
01:12.731 --> 01:16.605
After the accident, I added battery status, comm logs,

11
01:16.605 --> 01:18.605
update requests, everything.

12
01:18.605 --> 01:21.397
So, you have evidence it was hacked?

13
01:23.647 --> 01:26.397
They will tell us who did this.

14
01:39.689 --> 01:41.522
Mr. Cho?

15
01:41.522 --> 01:43.147
Good to see you.

16
01:43.147 --> 01:45.064
Uh, hi.

17
01:45.064 --> 01:47.564
This is your laptop, right?

18
01:48.605 --> 01:52.689
- Yes. - Good. You brought your own evidence.

19
01:52.689 --> 01:54.647
Evidence?

20
01:54.647 --> 01:56.023
I don't understand-.

21
01:56.023 --> 01:59.064
You were so busy tailing Yoon Ji Yoon,

22
01:59.064 --> 02:03.064
you didn't notice me following you.

23
02:20.939 --> 02:22.939
That Ms. Yoon you were chasing,

24
02:22.939 --> 02:25.105
she is one thorough woman.

25
02:25.105 --> 02:27.647
She is always prepared.

26
02:27.647 --> 02:29.939
Ms. Yoon had been storing log data

27
02:29.939 --> 02:32.772
to a backup cloud server in real time.

28
02:32.772 --> 02:34.647
Remote access records,

29
02:34.647 --> 02:36.355
battery overheating data,

30
02:36.355 --> 02:39.314
time of command, IP address list,

31
02:39.314 --> 02:43.355
and even the laptop serial number.

32
02:45.564 --> 02:48.230
I don't know what you're talking about.

33
02:48.230 --> 02:50.897
Cloud log? Serial number?

34
02:50.897 --> 02:54.355
Don't you know they're easy to manipulate?

35
02:55.731 --> 02:59.147
- You are framing- - It's all over.

36
03:03.355 --> 03:06.564
The laptop in your hand,

37
03:06.564 --> 03:10.814
it's the one used to give the command. You know that, don't you?

38
03:10.814 --> 03:14.605
Cho Geun Won, you are under arrest for illegal intrusion and attempted murder.

39
03:14.605 --> 03:18.147
You have the right to remain silent, and the right to an attorney,

40
03:18.147 --> 03:22.939
What you say can and will be used against you in court.

41
03:24.856 --> 03:27.105
- Not too rough. - Yes, ma'am.

42
03:37.023 --> 03:41.981
Cho Geun Won, what is your motive for doing this to Yoon Ji Yoon?

43
03:45.814 --> 03:48.397
I wanted to protect it.

44
03:49.522 --> 03:50.814
The company I built.

45
03:50.814 --> 03:53.064
No, you did it to hide.

46
03:53.647 --> 03:55.605
Hide what you did.

47
04:00.023 --> 04:02.064
That Baek Sung Min…

48
04:02.064 --> 04:03.897
All you have to do is to make him change his mind.

49
04:03.897 --> 04:06.188
You can't even do that?

50
04:09.272 --> 04:11.439
If you can't get the IPO,

51
04:11.439 --> 04:13.939
you are useless to me.

52
04:14.522 --> 04:18.397
When that happens, losing the company would be least of your worries.

53
04:20.397 --> 04:23.023
Your name will be obliterated

54
04:23.023 --> 04:27.647
from both the industry and academic circles.

55
04:38.480 --> 04:40.397
This is just a beta.

56
04:40.397 --> 04:42.355
We can sort it out before release!

57
04:42.355 --> 04:46.522
You've been saying that for three months already!

58
04:46.522 --> 04:48.023
Hey.

59
04:48.023 --> 04:51.272
Don't you see how important this is?

60
04:51.272 --> 04:52.647
If we give up,

61
04:52.647 --> 04:54.856
we can kiss investments and partners goodbye!

62
04:54.856 --> 04:57.981
So we should keep doing this until someone dies?

63
04:57.981 --> 05:00.439
People's lives are at stake!

64
05:00.439 --> 05:02.480
You are betting on a 'maybe.'

65
05:02.480 --> 05:04.230
That is not science!

66
05:04.230 --> 05:05.731
It's a gamble!

67
05:05.731 --> 05:07.397
Sung Min,

68
05:07.397 --> 05:10.355
when did you become such a coward?

69
05:10.355 --> 05:12.439
Geun Won.

70
05:12.439 --> 05:16.064
This is not cowardice. This is called responsibility.

71
05:17.188 --> 05:19.731
It's you who lost your way.

72
05:33.064 --> 05:36.023
Sung Min wouldn't back down.

73
05:36.564 --> 05:40.397
He insisted on going public with that beta code issue.

74
05:40.397 --> 05:43.355
He was even willing to shut the project down.

75
05:43.355 --> 05:44.772
- So- - So you pushed ahead anyway,

76
05:44.772 --> 05:48.105
even though you knew the risks.

77
05:48.105 --> 05:51.731
And tried to kill Yoon Ji Yoon so that the world wouldn't know?

78
05:54.023 --> 05:56.230
That's why you killed Dr. Baek too?

79
05:56.230 --> 05:58.272
- To shut him up? - No.

80
05:58.272 --> 05:59.647
I didn't kill Sung Min.

81
05:59.647 --> 06:02.023
- Mr. Cho- - I'm not lying.

82
06:02.023 --> 06:04.439
I was out of the country.

83
06:04.439 --> 06:06.480
It's not me, for real.

84
06:18.023 --> 06:22.480
I pulled this log data from the Chimera HQ server.

85
06:22.480 --> 06:26.856
The algorithm was planted around midnight on April 2nd.

86
06:26.856 --> 06:29.814
My admin account was used.

87
06:29.814 --> 06:32.689
But the IP address is not from a VPN.

88
06:32.689 --> 06:34.939
It's on Chimera's internal network.

89
06:34.939 --> 06:37.981
No sign of entry from outside at that time.

90
06:37.981 --> 06:39.897
Then Cho Geun Won's alibi is…

91
06:39.897 --> 06:43.272
If Mr. Cho was out of the country,

92
06:43.272 --> 06:45.355
he couldn't have accessed it in person.

93
06:45.355 --> 06:48.188
What does this mean? Someone from the company helped him?

94
06:48.188 --> 06:52.023
I created the admin account for research.

95
06:52.023 --> 06:55.314
I'm the only one who knows the password.

96
06:55.314 --> 06:57.647
No, there is one…

97
06:57.647 --> 06:59.689
Dr. Baek?

98
06:59.689 --> 07:02.147
- But Dr. Baek is… - No way.

99
07:02.147 --> 07:04.439
He was the one who died in that car.

100
07:04.439 --> 07:06.689
I can't imagine him doing that to his pregnant wife.

101
07:06.689 --> 07:07.814
No way.

102
07:07.814 --> 07:11.856
If it's neither Cho Geun Won nor Baek Sung Min, just who…

103
07:15.731 --> 07:18.522
The initial response improvement plan,

104
07:18.522 --> 07:21.564
the one you sent after the briefing,

105
07:21.564 --> 07:23.522
it was impressive.

106
07:23.522 --> 07:25.897
It can help us improve our response practices.

107
07:25.897 --> 07:30.605
And also, it will help us win back public trust.

108
07:30.605 --> 07:34.272
I only did what is required of me.

109
07:34.272 --> 07:38.480
What if we launch a pilot program at Namgang Station?

110
07:42.814 --> 07:44.605
If it goes well,

111
07:44.605 --> 07:47.439
I will consider a full-scale adoption.

112
07:47.439 --> 07:49.480
Thank you, ma'am.

113
07:49.480 --> 07:51.105
Thank you.

114
07:55.772 --> 07:59.188
Let's go, Koo Gyeong Mo!

115
07:59.814 --> 08:04.314
Koo Gyeong Mo! Koo Gyeong Mo!

116
08:04.314 --> 08:06.314
It's you! It's all you!

117
08:06.939 --> 08:09.105
I'm sure your promotion is on it's way.

118
08:09.105 --> 08:11.188
Thank you in advance.

119
09:21.605 --> 09:23.064
Yes?

120
09:25.856 --> 09:28.439
The new Director is here to see you, ma'am.

121
09:28.439 --> 09:30.939
[Senior Superintendent Shin So Jung] Oh, let her in.

122
09:37.939 --> 09:41.814
Detective Bureau Director Son Min A reporting.

123
09:43.355 --> 09:44.939
It's a pleasure, Director Son.

124
09:44.939 --> 09:48.147
Your reputation from the Busan Narcotics Unit precedes you.

125
09:48.147 --> 09:50.605
I hope you bring that skill to your work here.

126
09:50.605 --> 09:54.772
I will do my best to help the Division check all the marks.

127
09:54.772 --> 09:56.731
What tea would you like?

128
09:56.731 --> 09:58.480
I'm good.

129
10:01.939 --> 10:03.023
Sis!

130
10:03.023 --> 10:06.314
Sis, sis, sis! It's been so long!

131
10:06.314 --> 10:07.397
You!

132
10:07.397 --> 10:09.731
You never called! Its been ages!

133
10:09.731 --> 10:11.647
You got a makeover?

134
10:11.647 --> 10:14.105
You're not so bad yourself.

135
10:14.105 --> 10:16.856
There are so many narcotic cases.

136
10:16.856 --> 10:20.605
I was so busy chasing them around.

137
10:20.605 --> 10:22.981
Oh, right. Hyun Kyung joined the force?

138
10:22.981 --> 10:24.605
- Don't even talk about it. - Why?

139
10:24.605 --> 10:27.647
She's acting like a total stranger. It's so frustrating.

140
10:27.647 --> 10:30.689
She thinks the world will end if people find out I'm her mom.

141
10:30.689 --> 10:33.355
- You keep your mouth shut. - All right, all right.

142
10:33.355 --> 10:36.064
She's trying to make it on her own.

143
10:36.064 --> 10:37.939
It's admirable.

144
10:37.939 --> 10:41.147
- Speaking of which, will you be okay? - What?

145
10:41.147 --> 10:44.355
Now that you are here, you might bump into…

146
10:44.355 --> 10:46.564
You know…

147
10:46.564 --> 10:49.064
That was a long time ago.

148
10:49.064 --> 10:51.939
It's all in the past.

149
10:51.939 --> 10:54.355
- You sure? - Dead sure.

150
10:54.355 --> 10:57.314
I am. It's written on my face.

151
10:57.314 --> 11:00.689
Anyway, I'm so happy you're here.

152
11:00.689 --> 11:01.731
Me, too!

153
11:01.731 --> 11:03.272
What's with the outfit?

154
11:03.272 --> 11:05.147
It's so not you. What happened?

155
11:05.147 --> 11:07.564
I wanted to look good for you.

156
11:08.522 --> 11:11.023
Yes, come in.

157
11:12.064 --> 11:14.314
Superintendent Lee is here to see you.

158
11:17.731 --> 11:19.439
Good to see you.

159
11:19.439 --> 11:21.439
You two haven't met, have you?

160
11:21.439 --> 11:24.897
This is Son Min A, the new Detective Division Director.

161
11:30.981 --> 11:34.355
Son Min A. Superintendent Lee Tae Ju, right?

162
11:34.355 --> 11:37.981
Yes. Lee Tae Ju, from Violent Crimes.

163
11:37.981 --> 11:39.689
I heard a lot about you.

164
11:39.689 --> 11:40.981
What about?

165
11:40.981 --> 11:43.064
That I've got bad temper?

166
11:44.147 --> 11:46.355
That you always get the job done.

167
11:46.355 --> 11:48.731
No one remembers if there is no results.

168
11:48.731 --> 11:50.522
Victims, especially.

169
11:51.605 --> 11:55.397
I asked around about you, too.

170
11:55.397 --> 11:59.480
You seem to be well connected, with both politicians and businessmen.

171
12:02.314 --> 12:03.522
Yes.

172
12:03.522 --> 12:05.981
I like meeting people from all walks of like.

173
12:06.689 --> 12:09.689
I'm the opposite.

174
12:09.689 --> 12:14.230
When an officer likes meeting people too much,

175
12:14.230 --> 12:16.480
it invariably causes trouble.

176
12:16.480 --> 12:18.439
I'll keep that in mind.

177
12:18.439 --> 12:22.105
I'll be in my best behavior as a public servant.

178
12:25.772 --> 12:29.480
Okay, can you excuse us?

179
12:37.897 --> 12:39.647
He's that guy, right?

180
12:39.647 --> 12:42.023
Pyo Myeong Hak's right hand man.

181
12:43.147 --> 12:46.856
And the one who stabbed him in the back.

182
12:46.856 --> 12:48.814
Keep an eye on him.

183
12:48.814 --> 12:50.772
We just need to follow Lee Tae Ju,

184
12:50.772 --> 12:53.814
and he will lead us to the lesion we must carve out.

185
12:55.897 --> 12:58.439
I'm so relieved you're here.

186
13:02.856 --> 13:05.689
I thought we could close the case when we caught Cho Geun Won.

187
13:05.689 --> 13:07.355
Now we're back to square one.

188
13:07.355 --> 13:10.064
I haven't let him off the hook.

189
13:10.064 --> 13:13.605
I mean, one of the three suspects is dead,

190
13:13.605 --> 13:15.897
another one almost died,

191
13:15.897 --> 13:17.272
Cho Geun Won is the only one left.

192
13:17.272 --> 13:19.188
His alibi checks out, though.

193
13:19.188 --> 13:20.439
You're right.

194
13:20.439 --> 13:22.814
I think it's strange, too.

195
13:22.814 --> 13:25.230
Except for us three,

196
13:25.230 --> 13:28.105
no one in our company has the required skills.

197
13:31.064 --> 13:32.439
And you are…

198
13:33.647 --> 13:35.105
not it, are you?

199
13:35.939 --> 13:39.772
Didn't you check my alibi?

200
13:39.772 --> 13:41.689
Yes, she was in the karaoke.

201
13:41.689 --> 13:43.647
You saw the CCTV footage.

202
13:43.647 --> 13:46.439
- You're right. - What do you even sing?

203
13:46.439 --> 13:48.605
For three hours, alone?

204
13:48.605 --> 13:50.814
It's my hobby from college.

205
13:50.814 --> 13:53.480
Now, it's like a habit.

206
13:55.147 --> 13:58.355
It's my stress coping mechanism.

207
13:59.397 --> 14:00.981
Here's your kimchi jjigae.

208
14:00.981 --> 14:03.480
I could empty three bottles with this.

209
14:03.480 --> 14:05.814
Control yourself. The case is still open.

210
14:05.814 --> 14:09.397
Now that the food is here, why don't we take a shot first?

211
14:09.397 --> 14:10.981
- Sure. - Yeah.

212
14:10.981 --> 14:13.064
Cheers!

213
14:19.897 --> 14:23.272
Wow, Inspector Cha's friend,

214
14:24.064 --> 14:25.939
you sure can hold your liquor.

215
14:26.480 --> 14:29.689
Pace yourself. You live far from here.

216
14:31.314 --> 14:33.522
Don't worry.

217
14:33.522 --> 14:35.814
I can take care of myself.

218
14:42.397 --> 14:44.314
Eat, eat.

219
14:48.105 --> 14:50.188
Okay.

220
15:02.314 --> 15:04.939
[Traffic Civil Petition 24]

221
15:08.230 --> 15:10.605
[Accident: Search results]

222
15:14.272 --> 15:16.939
[Auto-bicycle collision]

223
15:25.397 --> 15:29.188
I knew she was drinking too fast.

224
15:29.188 --> 15:31.731
Ji Yoon, you okay? Need help?

225
15:31.731 --> 15:33.522
I'm fine!

226
15:33.522 --> 15:35.439
I'm almost done.

227
15:36.480 --> 15:39.023
She is far from done.

228
15:39.023 --> 15:40.689
Gosh.

229
15:45.772 --> 15:47.188
Feeling better?

230
15:47.188 --> 15:49.605
Yes, I emptied it all out.

231
15:51.355 --> 15:53.105
I'm really sorry.

232
15:53.105 --> 15:55.064
To you, and your father, too.

233
15:55.064 --> 15:57.480
Well, you should be.

234
15:57.480 --> 16:00.230
Buy me a drink sometime, if you're sorry.

235
16:00.230 --> 16:02.939
Sure. I'll buy you a drink…

236
16:04.939 --> 16:06.939
No, let's just eat. Food.

237
16:06.939 --> 16:08.355
Just food.

238
16:08.355 --> 16:09.939
Whatever you like.

239
16:11.814 --> 16:14.355
Now, go to bed.

240
16:14.355 --> 16:16.689
You can sleep here.

241
16:16.689 --> 16:19.064
Such a long day. So long.

242
16:19.064 --> 16:20.314
I'll turn the light off.

243
16:20.314 --> 16:21.605
Okay.

244
16:22.188 --> 16:24.981
And, thank you.

245
16:25.939 --> 16:27.605
What for?

246
16:27.605 --> 16:31.064
I was too overwhelmed to thank you properly,

247
16:31.064 --> 16:33.064
for saving me, I mean.

248
16:34.814 --> 16:36.397
You are amazing.

249
16:36.397 --> 16:38.230
You could have been hurt.

250
16:38.230 --> 16:40.439
But you threw yourself into danger.

251
16:42.147 --> 16:44.772
Because I don't want to regret it.

252
16:45.731 --> 16:47.897
I don't want anyone

253
16:47.897 --> 16:51.023
to get hurt or die on my account.

254
16:58.023 --> 17:01.397
[How to build self-driving cars]

255
17:09.647 --> 17:11.856
Who is this?

256
17:14.772 --> 17:17.647
My first mentor, from when I joined the force.

257
17:18.564 --> 17:20.147
You look like sisters.

258
17:20.147 --> 17:22.147
Where is she now?

259
17:23.731 --> 17:26.105
She died, because of me.

260
17:31.064 --> 17:34.105
Who calls at this hour?

261
17:37.272 --> 17:38.939
Yes, Investigator Cha.

262
17:40.522 --> 17:41.939
Huh?

263
17:46.647 --> 17:50.564
Do you have to do this now?

264
17:50.564 --> 17:53.439
Ji Yoon was up all night throwing-

265
17:57.064 --> 18:00.314
It's the only way to prove my theory.

266
18:00.314 --> 18:02.355
And it's safer

267
18:02.355 --> 18:04.480
when there is no car around.

268
18:05.188 --> 18:07.230
- Ready? - Yeah.

269
18:07.230 --> 18:10.731
Wait, wait. It's gonna stop, right?

270
18:10.731 --> 18:11.939
Right?

271
18:11.939 --> 18:15.064
Well, I haven't done this before.

272
18:15.064 --> 18:17.147
I'll start the car.

273
18:17.147 --> 18:18.439
Okay.

274
18:35.480 --> 18:38.188
- Stop the car! - The brake is not working!

275
18:47.605 --> 18:49.355
We stopped.

276
18:49.355 --> 18:50.856
Thank god we're alive.

277
18:50.856 --> 18:52.981
Are you all right? Good job.

278
18:52.981 --> 18:55.480
Good work.

279
18:55.480 --> 18:58.023
Shall we do it again, just in case?

280
18:58.023 --> 18:59.522
Huh?

281
19:04.522 --> 19:06.397
Lee Do Hyun was the target?

282
19:06.397 --> 19:08.397
I'm saying he could have been.

283
19:08.397 --> 19:11.605
Who would target Lee Do Hyun? And why?

284
19:11.605 --> 19:16.023
I checked the accident records, and found another one in February.

285
19:16.023 --> 19:18.355
Han Soo In's car hit Lee Do Hyun,

286
19:18.355 --> 19:19.731
while he was riding a bicycle.

287
19:19.731 --> 19:23.023
Lee Do Hyun, of all people? Talk about bad coincidence.

288
19:23.023 --> 19:24.731
Two accidents in a row?

289
19:24.731 --> 19:27.147
I asked the insurer, and

290
19:27.147 --> 19:30.522
these two argued over fault allocation.

291
19:30.522 --> 19:34.023
More like, Lee Do Hyun was giving her a hard time over the fault issue.

292
19:34.023 --> 19:37.897
Are you saying Han Soo In could have killed Lee Do Hyun because of that?

293
19:37.897 --> 19:39.272
Even if she had the motive,

294
19:39.272 --> 19:42.064
she didn't have the skills.

295
19:42.064 --> 19:44.188
Yeah, she would have had to

296
19:44.188 --> 19:46.397
- tinker with the self-driving algorithm. - You're right.

297
19:46.397 --> 19:48.689
- What? - Right about what?

298
19:48.689 --> 19:51.647
Right about Han Soo In lacking the skills, or about Baek Sung Min helping her?

299
19:51.647 --> 19:52.981
Without Baek Sung Min's help,

300
19:52.981 --> 19:54.939
it would not have been possible.

301
19:54.939 --> 19:59.564
With both Cho Geun Won and Yoon Ji Yoon removed from the suspect list,

302
19:59.564 --> 20:02.480
The only one capable of committing this crime is Baek Sung Min.

303
20:02.480 --> 20:06.522
But Baek Sung Min is dead. He was killed in the accident.

304
20:07.314 --> 20:09.939
What is for sure, is that for this crime to work,

305
20:09.939 --> 20:12.689
Baek Sung Min must be involved.

306
20:12.689 --> 20:14.064
To put it simply,

307
20:14.064 --> 20:18.314
he's like a 'necessary condition' that makes the proposition true.

308
20:18.314 --> 20:19.981
How's that 'simple'?

309
20:19.981 --> 20:23.605
Whatever it is, Baek Sung Min was involved?

310
20:23.605 --> 20:24.814
Yes.

311
20:24.814 --> 20:27.772
However, killing a man over fault allocation,

312
20:27.772 --> 20:30.814
is not a valid motive for murder.

313
20:30.814 --> 20:33.814
I think we need to look into the relationship

314
20:33.814 --> 20:36.522
between Han Soo In, Baek Sung Min and Lee Do Hyun.

315
20:39.023 --> 20:41.439
[Driver: Han Soo In]

316
20:44.230 --> 20:45.689
I heard about the case.

317
20:45.689 --> 20:48.522
So, someone hacked the car?

318
20:48.522 --> 20:51.064
Yes. This is the black box from the car.

319
20:51.064 --> 20:54.064
Can you restore the deleted data?

320
20:54.064 --> 20:57.147
Didn't you have them restored already?

321
20:57.147 --> 21:00.564
We focused on driver error at the time,

322
21:00.564 --> 21:02.480
so we didn't do a full restoration.

323
21:02.480 --> 21:05.605
Okay. I will do my best.

324
21:05.605 --> 21:07.272
Thank you.

325
21:07.272 --> 21:09.689
How's the Captain doing?

326
21:09.689 --> 21:11.647
Just his normal self.

327
21:13.314 --> 21:18.023
Oh, I was going to contact him.

328
21:18.023 --> 21:20.314
It's about his wife's case.

329
21:20.314 --> 21:23.480
I think DNA amplification might help.

330
21:25.188 --> 21:26.939
What are you talking about?

331
21:26.939 --> 21:29.188
Oh, you didn't know.

332
21:29.856 --> 21:33.856
Captain Jung is still on the hit-and-run case.

333
21:33.856 --> 21:36.605
He comes here every time a similar accident occurred,

334
21:36.605 --> 21:38.731
asking about DNA evidence.

335
21:40.105 --> 21:42.147
At his wife's scene of accident,

336
21:42.147 --> 21:46.605
we found some DNA that may belong to the driver.

337
21:46.605 --> 21:49.897
We couldn't analyze it at the time.

338
21:49.897 --> 21:53.480
Now, we have the tech to amplify it.

339
22:00.856 --> 22:03.272
[Call Detail Records]

340
22:40.814 --> 22:43.230
Why is there no egg?

341
22:43.230 --> 22:44.522
You already ate it.

342
22:44.522 --> 22:46.105
I did?

343
22:59.480 --> 23:00.897
Lieutenant.

344
23:00.897 --> 23:02.981
Have some drinks.

345
23:04.939 --> 23:07.147
Thank you.

346
23:11.439 --> 23:13.272
Nice drink.

347
23:13.272 --> 23:15.105
Man, it's good.

348
23:17.480 --> 23:19.064
Take a seat.

349
23:19.064 --> 23:21.147
Oh, okay.

350
23:23.814 --> 23:25.147
How's work treating you?

351
23:25.147 --> 23:28.689
I think I found the right job.

352
23:28.689 --> 23:30.230
Glad to hear it.

353
23:33.772 --> 23:36.772
I heard you nagged Superintendent Yeom so hard

354
23:36.772 --> 23:38.939
to assign you to our team.

355
23:38.939 --> 23:40.856
Yes, I did.

356
23:40.856 --> 23:42.439
Why do you want to work with us?

357
23:42.439 --> 23:45.897
I think what you do here is so cool,

358
23:45.897 --> 23:47.981
and it looks kind of fun, actually.

359
23:47.981 --> 23:50.480
Also, I have so many questions.

360
23:51.105 --> 23:52.897
What about?

361
23:52.897 --> 23:55.981
About many things.

362
24:02.064 --> 24:04.939
Well, I don't know.

363
24:04.939 --> 24:07.272
It may look like it, but

364
24:07.272 --> 24:10.272
it's not all fun and games here.

365
24:10.272 --> 24:14.647
Sometimes, it's so hard I can't take it.

366
24:14.647 --> 24:16.605
Sometimes,

367
24:16.605 --> 24:19.605
I just want to run away.

368
24:19.605 --> 24:21.272
Sometimes,

369
24:21.272 --> 24:24.897
it feels it's worth all that.

370
24:27.230 --> 24:29.939
Well, just hang tight.

371
24:29.939 --> 24:32.814
Who knows? You may work here after training.

372
24:32.814 --> 24:34.605
I'll do my best.

373
24:34.605 --> 24:36.772
Thanks for the drink.

374
25:01.856 --> 25:04.731
Look at this. This is Han Soo In's black box data.

375
25:04.731 --> 25:08.314
Han Soo In visited the same place three times in the past month.

376
25:08.314 --> 25:09.856
Including the day before the crash.

377
25:09.856 --> 25:11.522
Where is that?

378
25:11.522 --> 25:13.397
It's near Paldang Dam.

379
25:13.397 --> 25:16.272
Why go there? There's nothing there.

380
25:16.272 --> 25:17.689
Hold on a minute.

381
25:17.689 --> 25:19.731
Is it Joan-myeon, Namyangju-si?

382
25:19.731 --> 25:21.731
I checked the taxi payment records,

383
25:21.731 --> 25:23.689
Baek Sung Min was there before the crash.

384
25:23.689 --> 25:26.272
- Time? - Around 3 p.m.

385
25:26.981 --> 25:28.439
[Joan-myeon, Namyangju-si]

386
25:28.439 --> 25:30.731
Baek Sung Min and Han Soo In visited the dam before the crash,

387
25:30.731 --> 25:33.605
but they went there separately.

388
25:33.605 --> 25:36.981
To meet up there and plan the murder?

389
25:36.981 --> 25:40.689
Why would they do it there? They could discuss it at home.

390
25:41.605 --> 25:44.147
Maybe it was a plan that required some practice.

391
25:44.147 --> 25:46.856
Like, killing someone with a car.

392
25:47.772 --> 25:48.981
[Joan-myeon, Namyangju-si]

393
26:15.564 --> 26:19.564
Why did Han Soo In come here? Not just once, but three times?

394
26:21.689 --> 26:23.856
CCTV.

395
26:23.856 --> 26:26.355
Let's split up and look for it.

396
26:27.355 --> 26:29.064
Let's go, let's go.

397
26:38.439 --> 26:39.605
Detective Eo?

398
26:39.605 --> 26:40.856
What is it?

399
26:40.856 --> 26:43.147
Do you have some time?

400
26:43.147 --> 26:44.605
Time?

401
26:44.605 --> 26:47.355
I found something that stands out.

402
26:47.355 --> 26:49.939
Can you come with me for a minute?

403
27:18.105 --> 27:21.064
I found a CCTV camera.

404
27:21.064 --> 27:22.605
Wait, wait.

405
27:23.522 --> 27:25.731
You better wait here. Let me go alone.

406
27:25.731 --> 27:27.939
Why? I'll go with you.

407
27:27.939 --> 27:30.605
It's a urology clinic. And you are…

408
27:31.188 --> 27:32.522
A woman?

409
27:32.522 --> 27:34.605
Women have urinal systems, too.

410
27:34.605 --> 27:35.814
Move!

411
27:35.814 --> 27:38.188
Please. I'll be real quick.

412
27:38.188 --> 27:39.939
You can't block the entrance.

413
27:39.939 --> 27:41.439
We are police. Here for an investigation.

414
27:41.439 --> 27:43.439
Not that I have any issues.

415
27:43.439 --> 27:45.314
Okay, come in.

416
27:45.314 --> 27:47.023
Won't take long.

417
27:52.856 --> 27:56.689
1st April, 3:12 p.m, here.

418
27:56.689 --> 27:59.188
- Play it faster. - Okay.

419
28:02.564 --> 28:04.397
What is she doing? DUI?

420
28:04.397 --> 28:06.397
Let's watch a bit longer.

421
28:13.647 --> 28:15.439
She had company.

422
28:15.439 --> 28:17.355
Looks like a man. Is it the husband?

423
28:17.355 --> 28:19.064
It can't be him.

424
28:19.064 --> 28:20.731
He went there by taxi.

425
28:20.731 --> 28:22.522
Who, then?

426
28:22.522 --> 28:25.105
Do we have Lee Do Hyun's cell site access records?

427
28:25.105 --> 28:27.480
Yes, I do.

428
28:31.981 --> 28:33.355
Here.

429
28:37.480 --> 28:40.856
The cell site is in Joan-myeon.

430
28:42.188 --> 28:43.564
Then it means that man is…

431
28:43.564 --> 28:46.147
If Lee Do Hyun and Han Soo In were together,

432
28:46.147 --> 28:49.105
their relationship might be something we didn't expect.

433
28:50.397 --> 28:51.981
- Jackpot! - You scared me!

434
28:51.981 --> 28:53.522
We hit the jackpot.

435
28:53.522 --> 28:54.856
What are you fussing about?

436
28:54.856 --> 28:58.439
The baby Han Soo In is carrying, is not Baek Sung Min's.

437
28:58.439 --> 29:00.814
Baek Sung Min is not the father? What are you talking about?

438
29:00.814 --> 29:03.522
Baek Sung Min's credit card records showed visits to an urology clinic.

439
29:03.522 --> 29:04.605
So we went to check.

440
29:04.605 --> 29:06.314
Baek Sung Min can't have babies.

441
29:06.314 --> 29:08.564
That's right. He's…

442
29:09.856 --> 29:11.772
- Infertile! - Infertile?

443
29:11.772 --> 29:12.981
[Diagnosed with azoospermia]

444
29:12.981 --> 29:14.605
This is crazy.

445
29:14.605 --> 29:16.772
Now I get the picture.

446
29:16.772 --> 29:18.814
The first accident was not just bad luck.

447
29:18.814 --> 29:21.105
They were already seeing each other.

448
29:23.064 --> 29:24.772
Get a statement from her.

449
29:24.772 --> 29:27.230
I'll go. Inspector Cha, you're with me.

450
29:27.230 --> 29:28.689
Nice one.

451
29:31.897 --> 29:34.897
Dae Se!

452
29:34.897 --> 29:38.023
You did great.

453
29:38.023 --> 29:40.689
Good for you.

454
29:42.230 --> 29:44.439
I'm glad to see you're well.

455
29:45.272 --> 29:48.064
It was not a serious injury.

456
29:49.814 --> 29:52.439
About Lee Do Hyun, the one who passed,

457
29:53.439 --> 29:56.522
Records say you had met him a year before the accident,

458
29:56.522 --> 29:59.772
because of a fender-bender between your car and his bicycle.

459
30:01.355 --> 30:04.605
Yes, but I didn't know his name at the time.

460
30:05.731 --> 30:08.230
Did you see him after the first accident?

461
30:08.230 --> 30:10.689
There's no reason for me to.

462
30:11.230 --> 30:13.105
No, I didn't.

463
30:24.230 --> 30:26.897
This is Dr. Baek's physical exam records.

464
30:26.897 --> 30:30.105
Dr. Baek could not have babies.

465
30:30.105 --> 30:32.230
He was infertile.

466
30:32.230 --> 30:36.439
We know you are pregnant, so we went to the hospital to check.

467
30:38.272 --> 30:40.397
The child.

468
30:40.397 --> 30:42.397
Lee Do Hyun's the father, isn't he?

469
30:43.939 --> 30:47.064
Dr. Baek knew what was going on between you two.

470
30:47.064 --> 30:50.772
He followed you to Paldang Dam, where you used to meet in secret.

471
30:50.772 --> 30:53.731
He must have watched you for a long time.

472
30:53.731 --> 30:56.772
That was the motive for this crime.

473
30:56.772 --> 30:58.856
I can't believe it.

474
30:59.522 --> 31:02.272
I can't believe he did such a terrible thing.

475
31:02.272 --> 31:04.856
Which is more terrible?

476
31:05.439 --> 31:09.397
Trying to keep him in the dark when you carry another's baby?

477
31:09.397 --> 31:10.731
Or,

478
31:10.731 --> 31:15.023
planning a murder out of vengeance and humiliation?

479
31:24.522 --> 31:28.023
[Deceased: Lee Do Hyun]

480
31:33.605 --> 31:35.897
They died because of me.

481
31:38.689 --> 31:41.064
I had to stop.

482
31:44.605 --> 31:46.981
It's all because of me.

483
32:14.023 --> 32:15.772
Investigator Cha, do you have some coins?

484
32:15.772 --> 32:17.314
No.

485
32:28.772 --> 32:31.105
I can't believe it.

486
32:31.814 --> 32:35.105
Dr. Baek seemed like a good researcher.

487
32:36.023 --> 32:39.105
How could he plan something so cruel?

488
32:39.105 --> 32:41.856
I think he was living in a hell

489
32:41.856 --> 32:44.856
that he created in his mind.

490
32:46.480 --> 32:49.856
He did something that he felt

491
32:49.856 --> 32:52.023
was the only way out of there.

492
32:52.023 --> 32:54.981
So she lied through her teeth the whole time.

493
32:54.981 --> 32:59.147
Cheating is bad enough, but this is beyond my grasp.

494
32:59.147 --> 33:01.105
Who did what?

495
33:01.731 --> 33:04.564
Who cheats on his wife when she's pregnant?

496
33:04.564 --> 33:08.522
- No one said that. Literally no one. - Gotta break all his bones.

497
33:08.522 --> 33:10.564
Starting with his legs.

498
33:10.564 --> 33:12.856
And then work up his body.

499
33:12.856 --> 33:15.439
Break'em like twigs.

500
33:15.439 --> 33:18.188
Don't listen to your mother, little one.

501
33:18.188 --> 33:21.105
Good thoughts, nice thoughts.

502
33:21.105 --> 33:23.105
There, there.

503
33:23.105 --> 33:25.272
Thank God you're here.

504
33:25.272 --> 33:27.355
Do you have a coin?

505
33:27.355 --> 33:30.605
How dare you.

506
33:30.605 --> 33:33.564
You're extorting a pregnant woman.

507
33:33.564 --> 33:35.772
- Pretty please? - Here.

508
33:35.772 --> 33:37.605
Thank you, ma'am.

509
33:39.522 --> 33:41.023
What a waste.

510
33:41.023 --> 33:44.147
It's okay. I've got more.

511
33:55.355 --> 33:56.981
Could it be?

512
33:59.605 --> 34:02.522
I have to be somewhere.

513
34:08.439 --> 34:10.647
Wait! Stop that for a second.

514
34:10.647 --> 34:11.856
- Is that the one? - Yeah.

515
34:11.856 --> 34:14.064
We're from the police.

516
34:14.064 --> 34:15.647
So sorry, sir.

517
34:15.647 --> 34:17.689
Just hurry, okay?

518
34:19.188 --> 34:21.480
- Is it there? - Hold on a minute.

519
34:34.188 --> 34:37.105
I have nothing else to say.

520
34:37.647 --> 34:39.314
Ms. Han,

521
34:39.981 --> 34:41.897
at Paldang Dam,

522
34:41.897 --> 34:46.605
there is a ramp that goes into the river. Why did you go there?

523
34:46.605 --> 34:48.147
Well.

524
34:48.147 --> 34:49.856
We went for a drive.

525
34:49.856 --> 34:51.522
Went for a drive?

526
34:51.522 --> 34:53.522
Was that all?

527
34:54.480 --> 34:56.480
That's right.

528
34:56.480 --> 34:58.689
Could there be anything else?

529
35:11.397 --> 35:12.772
Now, don't forget.

530
35:12.772 --> 35:15.480
Put the wheel on the center line,

531
35:15.480 --> 35:17.897
and shift into neutral.

532
35:17.897 --> 35:22.105
Then turn the steering left and right, and the car will slide off.

533
35:22.105 --> 35:24.397
Now, this is important.

534
35:24.397 --> 35:26.731
Leave the driver side window open,

535
35:26.731 --> 35:29.147
and lock the passenger side window.

536
35:29.147 --> 35:32.272
And you must stay in the water as long as possible

537
35:32.272 --> 35:34.647
before you escape to the surface.

538
35:34.647 --> 35:36.147
Okay?

539
35:40.147 --> 35:42.272
But…

540
35:44.814 --> 35:46.647
wouldn't he wake up?

541
35:47.897 --> 35:49.480
Babe,

542
35:49.480 --> 35:53.023
we're talking about wine with two sleeping pills.

543
35:53.023 --> 35:55.480
An elephant wouldn't wake up.

544
35:55.480 --> 35:58.856
And you said he takes the pills all the time.

545
36:01.522 --> 36:03.689
What do I say to the police?

546
36:03.689 --> 36:06.772
They will think it's an accident.

547
36:06.772 --> 36:08.272
Let's go over it again.

548
36:08.272 --> 36:12.105
You went for a drive with him, and the car slipped.

549
36:12.105 --> 36:15.188
I barely made it out,

550
36:15.188 --> 36:17.605
but my poor husband did not.

551
36:17.605 --> 36:19.897
Won't they be suspicious?

552
36:19.897 --> 36:22.230
What is there to suspect?

553
36:22.230 --> 36:26.272
Even if they are suspicious, your father has your back.

554
36:27.772 --> 36:31.731
I think your father would be glad

555
36:31.731 --> 36:33.772
to get him out of the picture.

556
36:36.981 --> 36:40.939
Are you sure about the insurance claim?

557
36:40.939 --> 36:42.480
Come on.

558
36:42.480 --> 36:45.064
It's 100% failproof. It's not a suicide.

559
36:45.064 --> 36:46.480
Also...

560
36:47.105 --> 36:53.856
Your pregnancy will help us persuade the insurance guys.

561
36:55.814 --> 36:57.981
I'm so scared.

562
36:57.981 --> 37:01.064
Are you sure this is the only way?

563
37:02.230 --> 37:04.064
Babe,

564
37:04.064 --> 37:05.439
this is for us,

565
37:05.439 --> 37:09.939
and the baby in there.

566
37:09.939 --> 37:12.355
Baek Sung Min must die.

567
37:47.772 --> 37:51.897
I found this listening device in your car, Ms. Han.

568
37:51.897 --> 37:55.355
Dr. Baek had been listening to what you were saying in the car

569
37:55.355 --> 37:57.981
through his mobile phone.

570
37:57.981 --> 37:59.480
He heard everything,

571
37:59.480 --> 38:01.897
including the plan to murder him.

572
38:06.647 --> 38:09.314
I didn't plan to kill him.

573
38:09.314 --> 38:13.689
Do Hyun kept talking about it, so I just played along.

574
38:13.689 --> 38:16.564
I wasn't going to really do it.

575
38:16.564 --> 38:19.814
- It was like a joke- - Look, Han Soo In.

576
38:21.064 --> 38:23.939
You didn't just cheat on your husband, you even planned to kill him.

577
38:23.939 --> 38:26.897
It was all recorded, and this is still what you are saying?

578
38:45.439 --> 38:47.314
Dr. Baek, who found out that

579
38:47.314 --> 38:51.522
his wife was trying to kill him.

580
38:52.147 --> 38:54.731
Try to think what he must have felt.

581
39:06.272 --> 39:09.105
Dr. Baek planned his revenge.

582
39:10.355 --> 39:13.023
He devised a plan for his wife who planned to kill him.

583
39:13.023 --> 39:15.605
A plan to have her kill her own lover,

584
39:15.605 --> 39:18.647
and even himself.

585
39:18.647 --> 39:21.397
A fatally elaborate plan.

586
39:43.772 --> 39:45.731
Okay.

587
39:45.731 --> 39:47.939
I cheated on him.

588
39:47.939 --> 39:51.939
I admit it. But that isn't a crime.

589
39:51.939 --> 39:55.689
Bottom line is, my husband killed Do Hyun,

590
39:55.689 --> 39:58.522
and took his own life.

591
40:01.230 --> 40:04.147
I think we're done talking.

592
40:04.147 --> 40:06.023
I'm leaving.

593
40:06.023 --> 40:07.981
Sit down.

594
40:08.939 --> 40:12.064
Plotting to kill is a crime in itself.

595
40:12.064 --> 40:14.856
It's called premeditation, you know?

596
40:26.355 --> 40:30.105
We found this in Dr. Baek's office desk.

597
40:40.564 --> 40:42.397
Dear baby.

598
40:42.397 --> 40:47.023
I wonder what you are thinking in your mom's belly.

599
40:47.023 --> 40:52.772
I'm planting seeds of love in your heart.

600
40:52.772 --> 40:54.605
With love, your Dad.

601
40:54.605 --> 40:58.814
Forensically speaking, Dr. Baek took his own life.

602
40:58.814 --> 41:02.981
But I think there's more to it.

603
41:02.981 --> 41:05.772
He was killed.

604
41:05.772 --> 41:08.272
By his wife,

605
41:08.272 --> 41:09.814
and the ones closest to him,

606
41:09.814 --> 41:12.064
quietly,

607
41:12.064 --> 41:14.105
ever so slowly.

608
41:21.314 --> 41:24.105
I will call my father.

609
41:24.105 --> 41:25.689
You're in trouble.

610
41:25.689 --> 41:28.272
I'm not saying another word without my lawyer.

611
41:28.272 --> 41:30.314
Yeah, suit yourself.

612
41:30.314 --> 41:33.023
Make that call.

613
41:33.023 --> 41:36.272
But put these on, first. Don't move. It'll hurt.

614
41:36.272 --> 41:37.939
I mean it.

615
41:38.981 --> 41:40.647
Now, call your dad.

616
41:40.647 --> 41:42.814
Okay? Do it.

617
42:26.897 --> 42:28.397
[Seoul Namgang Police Station]

618
42:28.397 --> 42:30.689
[Investigation]

619
42:30.689 --> 42:32.064
[Sign In]

620
42:41.605 --> 42:43.772
[ID: Dong Gi]

621
42:43.772 --> 42:48.064
[General search]

622
42:49.856 --> 42:51.439
[Officer shot]

623
42:51.439 --> 42:54.147
[3 April 2016, Daejeon Hwado Station]

624
42:54.147 --> 42:57.522
[Firearm stolen and officer shot to death]

625
43:01.772 --> 43:03.856
During patrol, Lieutenant Park Hae Ok

626
43:03.856 --> 43:06.480
was attacked while approaching a suspect vehicle.

627
43:06.480 --> 43:08.314
Lieutenant Park was…

628
43:08.314 --> 43:09.355
Stop!

629
43:09.355 --> 43:12.605
Run over by the vehicle and shot to death by the suspect.

630
43:12.605 --> 43:14.856
Her partner failed to aid her.

631
43:16.647 --> 43:19.939
Partner Min So Hee was also attacked while responding on the scene.

632
43:19.939 --> 43:21.439
Drop the gun!

633
43:21.439 --> 43:24.814
Min So Hee was carrying a gun,

634
43:24.814 --> 43:29.105
but failed to respond in time.

635
43:38.480 --> 43:40.731
[Seoul Namgang Police Station]

636
43:41.856 --> 43:43.564
Okay.

637
43:58.147 --> 44:00.188
[Faster response, unwavering strength]

638
44:01.230 --> 44:06.105
Man, I thought you worked out!

639
44:06.105 --> 44:09.731
You won't even pass the qualification!

640
44:09.731 --> 44:11.772
I didn't sleep well.

641
44:11.772 --> 44:14.564
Why? Something's on your mind?

642
44:14.564 --> 44:16.856
Just some thoughts.

643
44:16.856 --> 44:18.522
Gosh.

644
44:18.522 --> 44:20.355
I will help you

645
44:20.355 --> 44:22.314
sleep like a baby today.

646
44:23.272 --> 44:24.939
Investigator Cha!

647
44:25.772 --> 44:27.647
No, you're not done.

648
44:27.647 --> 44:28.856
- Hey! - Too early.

649
44:28.856 --> 44:31.355
Can't breathe!

650
44:31.355 --> 44:33.272
Just tap!

651
44:34.230 --> 44:36.272
You trying to kill him?

652
44:38.897 --> 44:40.355
Hey!

653
44:40.355 --> 44:41.897
You should have tapped.

654
44:41.897 --> 44:43.939
- I can't. - Why not? Use this hand!

655
44:43.939 --> 44:45.480
I can't.

656
44:45.480 --> 44:47.230
You try it.

657
44:50.689 --> 44:52.772
Are you really letting him teach Dae Se?

658
44:52.772 --> 44:54.064
Why not do it yourself?

659
44:54.064 --> 44:56.064
What's wrong with letting Inspector Cha do it?

660
44:56.064 --> 44:59.897
I just can't imagine him teaching anyone.

661
44:59.897 --> 45:02.230
Right? I mean, it's a martial art.

662
45:02.230 --> 45:04.897
He's got no muscle, either.

663
45:04.897 --> 45:07.272
He is not what he used to be.

664
45:07.272 --> 45:09.480
He's been working out.

665
45:09.480 --> 45:14.981
Plus, he likes teaching others.

666
45:20.897 --> 45:22.397
Now,

667
45:22.397 --> 45:25.731
MMA fighter Wanderlei Simba said…

668
45:25.731 --> 45:28.772
MMA fighter Wanderlei Silva said,

669
45:28.772 --> 45:31.147
I don't fight with techniques. I fight with my heart.

670
45:31.147 --> 45:34.023
He said, I don't fight with techniques.

671
45:34.023 --> 45:35.772
I fight with my heart.

672
45:35.772 --> 45:38.814
Fighting is all about the spirit.

673
45:38.814 --> 45:41.064
It's Silva.

674
45:41.064 --> 45:43.480
Silva. Not Simba.

675
45:43.480 --> 45:46.897
Simba is the lion from Lion King.

676
45:46.897 --> 45:49.814
Ah, Silva. Of course.

677
45:50.731 --> 45:55.272
Police arrest tactics are designed to arrest and suppress criminals.

678
45:55.272 --> 45:58.439
However, what's more important

679
45:58.439 --> 46:01.023
is to protect yourself from resistance.

680
46:01.023 --> 46:02.856
If you get hurt,

681
46:02.856 --> 46:05.939
you lose the chance to put handcuffs.

682
46:09.314 --> 46:10.397
All right.

683
46:10.397 --> 46:11.731
Train as if it's a real fight.

684
46:11.731 --> 46:14.147
If you make me fall, training's over.

685
46:22.314 --> 46:24.105
Good.

686
46:24.105 --> 46:25.856
Bring it on.

687
47:07.981 --> 47:09.896
That's how he got me!

688
47:23.314 --> 47:24.981
Terrible, isn't it?

689
47:26.023 --> 47:28.272
Hurt, utterly helpless.

690
47:28.272 --> 47:30.522
Belittled,

691
47:30.522 --> 47:32.147
utterly helpless.

692
47:32.147 --> 47:34.272
The feeling like you're worthless?

693
47:34.272 --> 47:35.814
I felt the same at first.

694
47:35.814 --> 47:38.355
I know how it feels. I was like you.

695
47:38.355 --> 47:39.939
He stole my lines.

696
47:39.939 --> 47:42.731
But real growth begins

697
47:42.731 --> 47:45.480
the moment you admit your limitations.

698
47:45.480 --> 47:47.397
Remember that feeling.

699
47:47.397 --> 47:50.147
- Let's call it a day. - No.

700
47:50.147 --> 47:52.023
I'm not done.

701
48:02.397 --> 48:04.064
What are you doing?

702
48:06.439 --> 48:08.064
What?

703
48:13.814 --> 48:16.897
I mean, why are you…

704
48:22.147 --> 48:23.814
Let's go.

705
48:38.439 --> 48:40.480
What?

706
48:40.480 --> 48:42.397
Why did you suddenly take your clothes off?

707
48:42.397 --> 48:44.814
Train as if it's a real fight.

708
48:44.814 --> 48:47.272
Who knows?

709
48:47.272 --> 48:49.731
Suspects may attack you like this.

710
48:51.105 --> 48:53.480
Wow, Ji Dae Se.

711
48:53.480 --> 48:54.731
He's crazier than I thought.

712
48:54.731 --> 48:57.272
He looks good, though.

713
48:57.272 --> 48:59.105
What, his body?

714
48:59.731 --> 49:01.188
No, I mean his energy.

715
49:01.188 --> 49:03.355
- Nah, it's the body. - No, it's the energy.

716
49:03.355 --> 49:06.439
Inspector Cha has met his match.

717
49:14.897 --> 49:17.147
The technology we create

718
49:17.147 --> 49:20.480
must not be something we bet on.

719
49:20.480 --> 49:22.897
When we treat human lives as numbers

720
49:22.897 --> 49:26.355
in order to bring profits to investors,

721
49:26.355 --> 49:30.939
such technology is no longer 'smart.'

722
49:30.939 --> 49:33.314
Chimera's mission is to create

723
49:33.314 --> 49:38.856
technologies that protect humans, not defeat them.

724
49:38.856 --> 49:42.480
I will carry the mission forward,

725
49:42.480 --> 49:47.731
and ask myself this question over and over again,

726
49:47.731 --> 49:50.147
what should technology exist for?

727
49:55.939 --> 49:58.940
- I'm so moved, she spoke so well. - Right?

728
49:58.940 --> 50:02.105
Not a trace of her usual clumsy self.

729
50:02.105 --> 50:05.480
It feels like Tesla ten years ago.

730
50:05.480 --> 50:07.856
Gotta buy shares when they go public.

731
50:07.856 --> 50:09.522
Can't we like, use our acquaintance

732
50:09.522 --> 50:12.147
- to get some of the shares first? - No.

733
50:12.147 --> 50:15.147
They won't go public for a while.

734
50:31.397 --> 50:34.647
I think I can understand

735
50:34.647 --> 50:37.605
why Dr. Baek did what he did.

736
50:38.731 --> 50:42.355
He created the technology to make the world a better place.

737
50:42.355 --> 50:45.897
He dreaded the possibility that it might be used to kill people.

738
50:45.897 --> 50:48.314
He endured pressure from investors,

739
50:48.314 --> 50:52.188
and the constant demand to ignore ethics.

740
50:52.188 --> 50:55.522
He stood his ground without any complaints.

741
50:56.856 --> 50:59.897
But he must have felt that everyone,

742
51:00.439 --> 51:03.064
including his own wife,

743
51:03.064 --> 51:05.731
denied what he stood for.

744
51:05.731 --> 51:07.856
I think that despair,

745
51:07.856 --> 51:09.564
that utter loneliness,

746
51:09.564 --> 51:13.439
ultimately led him to taking his own life.

747
51:15.023 --> 51:17.272
He must've felt lonely.

748
51:17.272 --> 51:19.522
He's drowning, fighting for breath,

749
51:19.522 --> 51:21.772
while everyone around him

750
51:21.772 --> 51:24.772
is waiting for him to sink quietly.

751
51:26.689 --> 51:28.647
I should have done more.

752
51:29.272 --> 51:30.605
If I'd stood by him,

753
51:30.605 --> 51:33.856
- and supported him more- - It starts today.

754
51:35.689 --> 51:38.230
The burden Dr. Baek used to carry,

755
51:38.856 --> 51:40.731
now they are on your shoulders.

756
51:58.814 --> 52:01.647
Where's everybody? The office is empty.

757
52:01.647 --> 52:03.480
They're out on the field.

758
52:03.480 --> 52:06.272
- Can I help you? - No need.

759
52:06.272 --> 52:08.480
I just brought some documents.

760
52:16.147 --> 52:18.064
They're on your desk.

761
52:18.064 --> 52:20.689
It's from NFS.

762
52:23.564 --> 52:25.314
NFS?

763
52:35.647 --> 52:38.230
[NFS]

764
52:45.480 --> 52:47.814
[DNA Test Report]

765
52:51.147 --> 52:54.397
Hit-and-run on Yulmok Hill.

766
52:54.397 --> 52:57.814
Hubby, when will you get home?

767
53:03.522 --> 53:05.981
Previous analysis results,

768
53:05.981 --> 53:08.397
DNA amplification failed.

769
53:10.397 --> 53:14.023
[DNA Analysis Results]

770
53:16.480 --> 53:19.230
[STR Profiling Successful]

771
53:23.105 --> 53:26.480
The profile is ready for cross-checking

772
53:26.480 --> 53:28.605
with the NFS DNA database.

773
53:28.605 --> 53:31.105
[Test Requested By TCI]

774
53:31.105 --> 53:33.314
[Point Of Contact: Cha Yeon Ho]

775
53:38.272 --> 53:39.689
Cha Yeon Ho.

776
53:57.480 --> 54:00.897
ID and visitation request form, please.

777
54:28.023 --> 54:31.897
You keep coming here and asking the same questions.

778
54:31.897 --> 54:33.731
But my answer won't change.

779
54:33.731 --> 54:36.981
I met her.

780
54:36.981 --> 54:38.731
The cop?

781
54:40.981 --> 54:42.147
What did she say?

782
54:42.147 --> 54:45.605
She doesn't know who I really am.

783
54:49.772 --> 54:51.147
- We're back! - We're back!

784
54:51.147 --> 54:53.147
Captain! Yoon Ji Yoon was so cool!

785
54:53.147 --> 54:56.355
I guess position does make the person.

786
54:56.355 --> 54:59.023
Investigator Cha, let's talk.

787
55:15.188 --> 55:17.064
[DNA Test Report]

788
55:17.064 --> 55:19.105
- DNA test- - How dare you?

789
55:19.105 --> 55:20.856
You thought you can...

790
55:21.772 --> 55:26.480
Dig around my wife's case behind my back?

791
55:27.981 --> 55:31.272
I apologize for requesting the test without telling you first.

792
55:32.480 --> 55:34.647
I heard from NFS,

793
55:34.647 --> 55:37.981
that you were demoted while working on my case,

794
55:37.981 --> 55:40.480
and your wife had an accident afterwards.

795
55:42.939 --> 55:44.314
Maybe I am to blame.

796
55:44.314 --> 55:45.939
Don't get ahead of yourself.

797
55:45.939 --> 55:48.689
This has got nothing to do with you.

798
55:48.689 --> 55:53.647
It's not something you can use to relieve your sense of guilt.

799
55:55.731 --> 55:57.480
Stop pursuing the case.

800
55:58.230 --> 56:00.230
What are you afraid of?

801
56:02.522 --> 56:05.856
Reliving a past trauma just to not have any closure?

802
56:05.856 --> 56:07.480
Or,

803
56:07.480 --> 56:11.314
are you afraid to face that painful memory?

804
56:12.772 --> 56:14.439
Then why are you

805
56:14.439 --> 56:17.355
asking about the accident every time you visit NFS?

806
56:19.272 --> 56:22.064
The statute of limitations will expire in a month.

807
56:23.314 --> 56:25.314
It may be your last chance.

808
56:26.689 --> 56:29.439
At least check the DNA database.

809
56:58.814 --> 57:01.856
[Park Hae Ok, mother of Ji Dae Se]

810
57:03.439 --> 57:05.355
Mom,

811
57:05.355 --> 57:07.023
how are you doing?

812
57:10.188 --> 57:12.480
Mom, you once said,

813
57:13.064 --> 57:15.439
catching bad guys is easy,

814
57:16.272 --> 57:18.522
compared to not hating people.

815
57:21.314 --> 57:23.023
And I…

816
57:25.981 --> 57:28.439
It's really not easy for me.

817
57:34.897 --> 57:37.023
I'll get to the bottom of it.

818
57:38.480 --> 57:40.731
I promise.

819
58:27.897 --> 58:29.939
- Hey! - Make a wish.

820
58:29.939 --> 58:32.064
So we can be together for the birthday party.

821
58:32.064 --> 58:33.689
What is it?

822
58:33.689 --> 58:36.647
I'm good. Enjoy the cake.

823
58:37.981 --> 58:39.355
Was she hit?

824
58:39.355 --> 58:42.397
- I think she's hurt! - Will the baby okay?

825
58:42.397 --> 58:43.689
She pushed me!

826
58:43.689 --> 58:45.647
A friend would not force him

827
58:45.647 --> 58:47.480
to purchase a life insurance.

828
58:47.480 --> 58:48.397
A cop?

829
58:48.397 --> 58:50.731
There's a man down in the tunnel.

830
58:50.731 --> 58:52.689
Brake, brake!

831
58:53.731 --> 58:54.897
Shut your mouth!

832
58:57.564 --> 58:59.772
[People Of The Police Station]

833
59:06.856 --> 59:09.064
Cars these days are really smart.

834
59:09.064 --> 59:12.355
They adjust speed and find lanes on their own.

835
59:12.355 --> 59:14.272
They even help you brake.

836
59:14.272 --> 59:16.814
It feels like they can do everything.

837
59:16.814 --> 59:20.064
But don't be mistaken.

838
59:20.064 --> 59:23.897
They can help you drive, but they can't drive for you.

839
59:23.897 --> 59:26.314
Think of training wheels.

840
59:26.314 --> 59:28.814
You can't let go of the handle.

841
59:29.689 --> 59:33.856
The system may not recognize sudden cut-ins or stops.

842
59:33.856 --> 59:35.856
In fact, death toll from expressway accidents

843
59:35.856 --> 59:38.522
increased by more than 50% this year.

844
59:38.522 --> 59:42.856
The police attributed it to people's overconfidence in driving assistance.

845
59:42.856 --> 59:45.147
It is the same for DUI.

846
59:45.147 --> 59:47.314
Even if auto drive was on,

847
59:47.314 --> 59:50.023
you may be held responsible in case of an accident.

848
59:51.064 --> 59:54.439
And you may have wondered while watching the show,

849
59:54.439 --> 59:56.981
is it really possible to hack a car?

850
59:56.981 --> 59:59.105
Yes, they can.

851
59:59.105 --> 01:00:02.564
As early as ten years ago, someone hacked into moving cars,

852
01:00:02.564 --> 01:00:05.397
resulting in recalls of 1.4 million vehicles.

853
01:00:05.397 --> 01:00:07.188
Today,

854
01:00:07.188 --> 01:00:08.772
you can use apps

855
01:00:08.772 --> 01:00:11.897
to open doors and start the engine.

856
01:00:11.897 --> 01:00:14.272
The number of security breaches targeting these technologies

857
01:00:14.272 --> 01:00:16.939
has exceeded 400 per year.

858
01:00:16.939 --> 01:00:21.480
And most of them were attacked remotely.

859
01:00:21.480 --> 01:00:24.480
Remember two things.

860
01:00:24.480 --> 01:00:26.772
Update your software in time,

861
01:00:26.772 --> 01:00:29.647
and don't connect devices that you don't know about.

862
01:00:29.647 --> 01:00:31.689
Someone may hack into your car,

863
01:00:31.689 --> 01:00:33.981
to steal it or take control.

864
01:00:33.981 --> 01:00:36.981
Convenience is one thing, security is another.

865
01:00:36.981 --> 01:00:39.480
Security is your responsibility. Stay vigilant.

866
01:00:39.480 --> 01:00:41.647
Remember. It's you sitting behind the wheel,

867
01:00:41.647 --> 01:00:44.022
Not the car itself.

868
01:00:44.346 --> 01:00:46.346
MkvDrama.Net
